    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Noel Kelly Auctioneers Ltd are delighted to present to the market this stunning B-rated three-bedroom, own door duplex unit situated in the highly sought after development at The Coast in Baldoyle. The spacious accommodation comprises of entrance hallway, bedroom 1, guest WC, storage closet, door to communal gardens, large lounge/kitchen with a further door to large patio area and garden on ground floor level. Upstairs, there is a family bathroom, 2 spacious double bedrooms with fitted wardrobes (master en suite) and a balcony.\r\n15 Red Arches Close is presented in excellent condition with the added benefit of ample storage space, outdoor space, has ground floor ceiling height of 2.8m, and will appeal to first time buyers, investors or someone looking to downsize. \r\nThere is a designated parking space and visitor’s parking. The location couldn't be more convenient with all local amenities on your doorstep including the Coastal walks to Sutton and Portmarnock, excellent public transport including bus & DART services nearby ensuring fast access to the City Centre."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\t6.50 x .49\tDecorative timber floor, security alarm, coving, storage closet\r\nStorage Closet\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 2.61 x 3.48           Decorative timber floor, blinds\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room\t4.80 x 5.80\tFully fitted kitchen, dishwasher, oven, hob, extractor, 2 x light fittings, door to large patio area and garden\r\n\t\t\r\nPatio Area/ Garden\t\tDecking, large corner site\r\n\r\nGuest WC\t2.08 x 1.36\tTiled floor& partial walls, wc, whb, mirror, holders\r\n\r\nBathroom\t1.36 x 3.78\tTiled floor, part-tiled walls, w.c, w.h.b, bath suite with shower, mirrored cabinet,\r\ntowel rail, holder\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\t4.78 x 3.76\tCarpet floor, fitted wardrobe\r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 2 (Master) \t4.77 x 3.47\tCarpet floor, fitted wardrobes, door to balcony\r\n\t\t\r\nEn Suite \t3.50 x 1.23\tTiled floor, part-tiled walls, stand-alone shower, w.c, w.h.b, towel rail, mirrored cabinet, holder\r\n\r\nBalcony \t\tOverlooking green area"
      },
